 The AX identity path additionally enforces the Section 1.6 common model: JSON
 numbers are integral safe integers, and the exact `schema`/`schema_version`
-pair selects the schema-defined self field from the pinned v0.5.0 identity
-contract. Other registered ID names may remain as ordinary references; only
-the selected schema's own field is removed before JCS and SHA-256. Callers
